# graphify corpus exclusions (gitignore syntax), on top of .gitignore.
#
# The graph is code-only on purpose. Code is parsed locally (AST, no LLM), so the
# graph rebuilds for free and never drifts. Prose docs would need a manual LLM
# pass to stay current. For the "why", read docs/01-DECISIONS.md and
# docs/02-ARCHITECTURE.md directly.

# Prose docs, changelogs, runbooks, plans, ADRs
*.md

# Local working dumps
audit/

# Fixtures and seed data: fake project content
packages/integration-tests/fixtures/
scripts/seed-data/

# CI, tooling config and markup that graphify treats as documents
.github/
*.yml
*.yaml
*.html

# Build and tooling config: no architectural signal
tsconfig*.json
biome.json
turbo.json
components.json

# Platform binary packages: distribution shells with no source
packages/cli-*/

# Images
*.png
*.gif
*.svg
